  "notes": "ビニール{袋|ぶくろ} is the common term for plastic shopping bags.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ビニール{袋|ぶくろ}は{有料|ゆうりょう}です (Plastic bags cost extra)\n- ビニール{袋|ぶくろ}はいりますか (Do you need a bag?)\n\nUSAGE:\n- Plastic bag charges became mandatory in Japan in 2020\n- Also called レジ{袋|ぶくろ} (checkout bag)\n- Many people now bring マイバッグ (reusable bags)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {紙袋|かみぶくろ}: paper bag\n- マイバッグ: reusable shopping bag\n- レジ{袋|ぶくろ}: checkout bag",
